  "description": "Experience the pinnacle of uncoordinated combat. Battle friends and family in physics-driven sumo matches where your greatest enemy isn't the opponent, it’s your own center of gravity.\n\nLocal Multiplayer: Up to 4 players chaotic Free-for-All or Team modes.\n\nSlapstick Physics: Push, kick, grab, and hurl your opponents using unstable physics that turns every fight into a slapstick disaster.\n\nWin by any means necessary.\n\nHazardous Arena: Turn the arena into a weapon with interactive, ridiculous hazards.",
